<title>SINGAPORE: Nepal Jul 1-10 kerosene import tender closes Jun 3.</title>
<headline>Nepal Jul 1-10 kerosene import tender closes Jun 3.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Nepal Oil Corp has issued a tender to buy 30,000 tonnes of superior kerosene for July 1-10 delivery on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis to the Indian east coast, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on June 3 and offers will be valid for two days.</p>
<p>In its last tender, Nepal bought 30,000 tonnes of kerosene from Japan's Mitsubishi Corp at $204 per tonne for May 1-10 delivery, c-and-f Indian east coast.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
</text>
